## Pure helper module header (mirror `lib/trial.ts`)

```js
/**
 * <Feature> parsing and validation helpers.
 *
 * Keep this file free of I/O — it is imported by the route handler, future
 * background jobs, and unit tests, so it must be safe to import anywhere.
 */
```
